nota: IQA-IGAM: documented computational reproduction of the IGAM method (SCQA 2005 equations; Projeto Aguas de Minas rules). Not endorsed or certified by IGAM. Turbidity uses k = 1.5 (Bucci 2011; Nunes 2008) instead of the k = 15 printed in some SCQA copies. Reproduces 49/49 published IGAM IQAs (Pampulha sub-basin, 2017-2018). See system.file('methodology', 'IGAM_VALIDATION.md', package = 'tikatuwq'). 
erro sem nitrate_unit: nitrate_unit must be given explicitly ('N' for mg/L N-NO3 or 'NO3' for mg/L NO3): the IGAM curve is in mg/L NO3 and no unit is assumed. 
migracao: Argument 'classification' was removed from iqa() in tikatuwq 0.11.0: the classification scale now follows 'method'. To classify an IQA on another scale use classify_iqa(x, classification = ...). 

